      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "That’s Nothing"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小乐是一个吃货。",
      "traditional": "小樂是一個吃貨。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè shì yí ge chī huò",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le is a foodie."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "一天，保罗想吃荔枝罐头，",
      "traditional": "一天，保羅想吃荔枝罐頭，",
      "pinyin": "yì tiān bǎo luó xiǎng chī lì zhī guàn tou",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "可他用尽了全身力气也没能打开罐头盖子。",
      "traditional": "可他用盡了全身力氣也沒能打開罐頭蓋子。",
      "pinyin": "kě tā yòng jìn le quán shēn lì qi yě méi néng dǎ kāi guàn tou gài zi",
      "english": "One day, Paul wanted to eat canned lychee."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小乐看到了，说：“让我来吧！”",
      "traditional": "小樂看到了，說：“讓我來吧！”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè kàn dào le shuō ràng wǒ lái ba",
      "english": "But he couldn’t get the can lid open even after using up his entire body strength."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "只见小乐一用劲，罐头的盖子就开了。",
      "traditional": "只見小樂一用勁，罐頭的蓋子就開了。",
      "pinyin": "zhǐ jiàn xiǎo lè yì yòng jìn guàn tou de gài zi jiù kāi le",
      "english": "Little Le noticed this and said: “Let me do it!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "And just like that, as soon as Little Le exerted force, the can’s lid opened."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "保罗伸出大拇指：“小乐！你真厉害！”",
      "traditional": "保羅伸出大拇指：“小樂！你真厲害！”",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó shēn chū dà mu zhǐ xiǎo lè nǐ zhēn lì hai",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul extended his thumb: “Little Le! You’re amazing!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "小乐笑了，说：“这算什么，我还有更厉害的在后头呢！”",
      "traditional": "小樂笑了，說：“這算什麼，我還有更厲害的在後頭呢！”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè xiào le shuō zhè suàn shén me wǒ hái yǒu gèng lì hai de zài hòu tou ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le laughed and said: “That’s nothing! I still have something even more awesome to follow!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "说完，她拿起罐头，一口就把罐头吃光了。",
      "traditional": "說完，她拿起罐頭，一口就把罐頭吃光了。",
      "pinyin": "shuō wán tā ná qǐ guàn tou yì kǒu jiù bǎ guàn tou chī guāng le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "After she finished speaking, she grabbed the can and ate it all in one mouthful."
    }
  ],
